fix: 15 bugs, UX gaps, and performance issues

Bugs fixed:
- Terminal auto-fits on KeepAlive reactivation (onActivated + fit)
- Quick-connect no longer saves host (direct session connect)
- Disconnect detection shows red message in terminal
- SFTP refreshes on session switch (watch + onActivated)

UX improvements:
- Host edit dialog (click pencil icon on card)
- Duplicate host button (copy icon on card)
- Host cards now show edit/duplicate/delete on hover
- Live terminal theme updates from settings

Missing features:
- Export/import hosts via RPC (hosts.export / hosts.import)
- Host groups data wired (groups.list already existed)

Performance:
- Scrollback capped at 5000 lines (prevents memory bloat)
- SFTP client caching (reuses connection per session)
- Dead SFTP clients auto-detected and replaced
